OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum hotel closure date
OL,4,Aconfirmed, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hotel in Surrey will no longer be
OL,7,Fused as accommodation for asylum
OL,8,Fseekers, a council has said.
OL,10,FSpelthorne Borough Council said it was
OL,11,Ftold by the Home Office that the
OL,12,FStanwell Hotel, which has seen protests
OL,13,Fand counter-protests during its four
OL,14,Fyears housing asylum seekers, will stop
OL,15,Fbeing used for this purpose by the
OL,16,Fmiddle of February 2027.
OL,18,FThe council said it would engage with
OL,19,Fthe Home Office and the hotel to
OL,20,Funderstand the closure arrangements in
OL,21,Fmore detail, and would give more
OL,22,Finformation as it became available.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
